cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Shiraz
message: If you reference or evaluate Shiraz in research, benchmarks, or compatibility surveys, please cite this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Mohammad Mahdi Afshar
    alias: mamad
  - name: Shiraz Contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/spectre-oss/shiraz
url: https://shiraz.foo/
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  An open-source, GTK-free Android compatibility layer and local APK packaging
  toolchain (AppImage, Flatpak, signed macOS .app, Windows portable/MSIX) built
  on standalone ART, an API 35 Java framework surface, 15 NDK native libraries,
  SDL2 presentation, and native host OS bridges without a virtual machine or
  kernel binder module.
keywords:
  - android
  - android-compatibility-layer
  - android-runtime
  - art
  - apk
  - appimage
  - flatpak
  - linux
  - macos
  - windows
  - sdl2
  - opengl-es
  - vulkan
  - webrtc
  - webassembly
